            <ArticleTitle>7-Methoxybenzofuran-4-carboxamides as PDE 4 inhibitors: a potential treatment for asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2137-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The synthesis and pharmacological profile of a novel series of 7-methoxybenzofuran-4-carboxamides is described. Some of these compounds were found to be potent inhibitors of phosphodiesterase type 4 (PDE4).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
